The depth-one health-target failure, its living entry authority and causal
successor form one coface frontier.  The already generated field-grounded
typed revision realizes that same rooted failure and supplies the literal
`requiresU8` compiler image.  No root, ledger, occurrence or sibling revision
is introduced here.
-/

set_option autoImplicit false

namespace SaturationMonoid
namespace ProcessGame
namespace Society
